WEBVTT

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:33.170
I've done it. I've done it...

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:34.750
It's complete!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.560
It's finished!

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:37.180
It's perfect!

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.910
At last... At last, I have conquered
a realm beyond

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.910
even magic's reach!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.950
Terrifying... Truly terrifying!

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.220
My own talent terrifies me!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.210
What a genius I am.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.820
The genius of the century!

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.790
The terrifying ultimate genius!

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:05.800
Doctor West!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:09.830
Now... The moment of miracles!

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.840
<i>Magius Wing!</i>

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:53.850
Okay!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.030
Access!

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.730
Decoding via Aetheric Cipher.

00:02:58.730 --> 00:02:59.890
Spell Permutation!

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:03.160
Return to your true form, my fragment!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.810
We got it!

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.170
Well done, Kuro.

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:13.210
But we really made a mess...

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:17.960
I guess we should talk to the Hado lady.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.050
You really...

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.890
Did it never occur to you
to do your jobs quickly,

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.590
without damaging the surrounding area?

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.330
Every single time...

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.060
Think about those, like me,
who clean up after you!

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.310
Sacrifice is a part of battle.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.890
Have a generous heart and forgive us.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.400
What an impudent girl...

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.070
<i>Jeez.</i>

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.290
<i>These two never give up.</i>

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.620
You there.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.820
Why are you sitting there, elegantly
enjoying your tea

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.270
like this doesn't concern you?

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:50.940
Me?

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.400
Who else?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.560
You're a part of this, too!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:59.820
Inada, they're not guests,
so there's no need to serve them tea.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:02.190
No, I didn't...

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:04.530
Oh, I just made this myself.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.630
Why are you active so uselessly?

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:09.130
Anyway, I told you...

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.990
Without my pages, which are
scattered around the city,

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.100
I can't use my real power.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.840
Yes.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.540
And I've left that,

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.690
along with all else involving Demonbane,

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.810
in your hands, for the time being.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.790
That's what I said.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:25.960
Yeah.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:30.890
And we're helping in every way we can.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.170
But the reason I gave you Demonbane

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.300
was simply that, currently,
no one else can use it!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:38.560
That's all.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.490
Yeah.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:43.010
If you cause any more trouble,

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.500
I'll take Demonbane back immediately.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:51.140
No one in the world but Kuro and I
could master that thing.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.220
Hey!

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.020
Stop provoking her!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:59.410
We're off to look for the next fragment.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:01.380
Bye!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.380
Let's go, Al.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.310
This is...

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:25.370
Where we recovered the Mirror
of Nitocris yesterday.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:29.010
We really made a mess then, too...

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.580
The Mirror of Nitocris

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.380
is a terrible item that blurs the line

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:37.580
between reality and fiction,
making illusion into reality.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:41.090
We were lucky to get by
with such little damage.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.550
But you know...

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:46.060
I told you before,

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:49.920
if you want to minimize damage,
you must get stronger.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.560
That's another reason we need
to recover all my fragments.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.920
That's true.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:57.230
Stronger, huh?

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.860
It just showed up?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.260
In the middle of a busy street like this?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.300
It's coming, Kuro!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:38.100
The articles that detail how to create
the Scimitar of Barzai...

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.240
It's moving seriously fast!

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.350
Don't just stand there.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:42.130
We're catching it!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.010
How?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.380
We'll just have to think of something!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.750
You have no idea, do you?

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.670
Nose... My nose!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.870
Where were you looking?

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.540
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.100
We were in a hurry.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.640
Kuro Daijuji! Doctor West!

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:16.570
Another bother, and at a time like this...

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:19.000
If possible, I wanted to never see him again.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.320
We don't have time to deal with you.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.150
Get lost!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.290
What?

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.430
That's my line!

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:28.100
I am currently working to make

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:32.400
my ultimate masterpiece even
more perfect and complete!

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.710
Thus, I haven't even the slightest bit

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:40.170
of time to waste on you,
but I guess this is fine.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.400
Behind you! Behind you!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.510
Elsa!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.670
The result of many years of research...

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:51.470
The result of blood, sweat, and
just a few painful tears.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.960
Ultimate combat ability combined
with ultimate beauty,

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.410
my art's final result!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.690
And its name is...

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.190
Artificial Human Elsa!

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:03.700
What?

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.500
They're after the fragment?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.440
Hey... Hey, hey, hey...

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:16.480
And the robot, granted life by my genius mind,

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.200
will begin to struggle, questioning

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.470
whether her self and soul really exist.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.710
And something like a conscience
will then awaken,

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.410
at the sound of the professor's flute!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.160
She asks if Pinocchio was truly
happy, being human...

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:32.030
That Elsa thing's attack must've fired it up!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.260
It's gotten excited!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.430
They really didn't need to do that...

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:36.460
It's coming!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.330
Got it-robo!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:40.430
Fall-robo!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.830
Idiot...

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.340
Where'd it go?

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.620
<i>Atlach-Natcha!</i>

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.320
Got you!

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.710
Did you think you could get away?

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:08.960
Give up!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:09.720
You did it!

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.360
Atlach-Natcha already made itself useful!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.630
No, you don't-robo.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:16.180
Shifting mode from combat
to anti-magical equipment.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.280
Eject!

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.610
<i>Evocation Magic:</i>

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:22.440
<i>Dig Me No Grave!</i>

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:23.170
Fire!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.830
Too easy-robo.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.790
No match for Elsa-robo.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.640
Again?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.690
Oh, no!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.030
Robo?

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:55.440
Robo?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.290
That was close...

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.720
They're the enemy.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.060
What are you thinking?

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:04.260
Well, I couldn't just leave her there.

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:06.940
I've never been held by a man before-robo.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.800
What are you talking about now?

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.810
My generator output is increasing-robo.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.740
Confirmed rise in body temperature, too!

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:18.740
After firing all those guns, I bet you got hot.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.670
I see... This is love-robo?

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.870
What kind of logic path did this robot girl

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.060
follow to reach that conclusion?

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.940
I have no idea...

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.700
At the extremes of life and death,
love is born-robo!

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:35.240
In other words, I'm totally
in love with Kuro Daijuji,

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:37.140
who saved me from enemy hands!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.510
Love!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.650
Give me a break.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.480
Kuro, no time to play!

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:44.980
I'm not playing...

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:53.030
<i>Mirror of Nitocris!</i>

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.610
This is payback!

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:05.480
Take it!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.590
You did it!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:14.090
Okay, this time...

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.740
The fragment of Al Azif is mine.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.700
That's what you get.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.920
Why, you...

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.130
I'm amazed you survived...

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:33.640
Now that I have this fragment, I'm invincible!

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.800
What?

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:35.640
What do you mean?

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:37.500
Now, Kuro Daijuji!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.370
It's time for you to die.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:44.410
Don't worry. I'll give you the change
to cross the river Styx...

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.380
Elsa!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:50.130
Kuro Daijuji, we're like Romeo and Juliet-robo.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:51.390
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.930
Come here!

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:57.230
Super West Invincible Robot 28 Deluxe!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:07.500
Yes. This is my latest creation,
the Super West Invincible Robot 28 Deluxe...

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.210
AKA, Demonpain!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.500
Total knock-off...

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.240
Seems we need to show them the difference
between that and the real thing.

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.570
Kuro, summon it!

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.050
Right!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.850
Tracing Demonbane's materialization point.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:26.960
Putting image on main screen!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:32.540
It's a Deus Machina... No?

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:37.050
Two Demonbanes!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.690
It's just as strong as Demonbane!

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:54.950
Calm down!

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:58.490
Even if it looks similar, it's
just a mechanical doll.

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:00.620
Then I'll use this.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:13.840
<i>Atlantis Strike!</i>

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.180
I-Impossible.

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:25.880
It even has the Atlantis Strike?

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:29.420
It incorporates magic in its design?

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:34.090
You finally realized, Kuro Daijuji, Al Azif?

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.490
I get it!

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:38.860
He's using my stolen fragment as
a magical energy source!

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.630
That's right-robo!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:44.700
Kuro Daijuji, Elsa will defeat you
and win your love-robo!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.340
I'll pass.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.600
Robo?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.480
<i>Atlach-Natcha!</i>

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.010
What?!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.000
This is Al's own power.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.820
A fake can't use it!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:03.850
Now...

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:05.590
Now it's our turn-robo!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.060
Magical energy is building inside the enemy!

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.700
That light... It can't be the one from before...

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.530
<i>Mirror of Nitocris!</i>

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.440
Illusions?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.140
But it's not—

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.160
But it's not good enough.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:27.680
Dig Me No Grave's true value is
its adaptability-robo!

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:30.180
Spread beam-robo!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:30.910
What?

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.890
Too bad, Kuro Daijuji.

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:43.730
Once we've seen a technique—

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:46.330
...seen a technique, it won't
work on us again-robo!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.930
Demonbane hit!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:53.500
Magical circuits 13 to 54 are off-line.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.740
Errors reported in the left arm drive system.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:56.980
This is bad!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:58.640
At this rate even Demonbane...

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.880
Is there anything... Anything we can do?!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.550
Mistress?

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.650
Winfield?

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:09.390
There is one way...

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.390
Lemuria Impact?

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:15.790
You can't mean...

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:20.280
True, that fake Demonbane's never seen it.

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:24.770
And even if they had,
they'd never be able to block it!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.140
W-Wait!

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:30.310
We've never even done a single
startup test with it!

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:33.530
If it goes out of control, it will take out

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:36.760
not only Demonbane, but all of Arkham City.

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:42.210
The decision is yours.

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.250
We will obey it.

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.130
Mr. Daijuji? Al Azif?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.300
Can you hear me?

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:57.730
Princess?

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.470
What? We're in the middle of a fight!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.710
Mr. Daijuji,

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.970
I'm going to activate Lemuria Impact.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:05.180
Lemuria Impact?

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:12.550
Now, I'll finish y—

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:13.620
You!

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.220
Robo!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.920
Hiranyapura System activated.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.640
Encoding incantation.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:28.500
Construct Naacal Code!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.670
Roger!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:33.740
Spell Text Al Mankib and Spell
Text Al Dhira unlocked!

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:35.910
Spell Text Al Yad al Yamnā,

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:38.380
Spell Text Ibt al-Jauzā unlocked!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:41.320
Incantation's conversion to
Naacal Code complete!

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.550
Ready anytime!

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:48.250
Initiating transfer of Sublimation Spell 1.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.580
<i>You are the purifying flame of Betelgeuse!</i>

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.880
<i>The right hand of the giant, unleashed.</i>

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.250
<i>The sword of perfect victory!</i>

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:04.600
Transmitting Naacal Code!

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.610
Spell decompressed!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:25.320
Wh-What is this?

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:27.550
I never imagined it would be this strong...

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:30.360
But it's more than enough!

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.250
All right!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.760
Go, Kuro!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.240
<i>In a world filled with light...</i>

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:45.810
<i>There is no room for darkness to dwell!</i>

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:52.010
<i>Return to nothingness, never thirsting,
never hungering!</i>

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:08.190
<i>Lemuria!</i>

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.170
<i>Impact!</i>

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:14.910
<i>Sublimate!</i>

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.810
Robo...

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:09.430
Amazing...

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:10.660
This is...

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:14.560
An unstoppable spell, which destroys the
enemy at the Azathoth level.

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.890
The ultimate technique,

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:21.240
creating conditions of zero mass,
infinite gravity, and infinite heat.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:24.560
Close-Range Sublimation Spell 1:

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.550
Lemuria Impact!

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:40.790
Kuro Daijuji, I'll let you have your
victory for today-robo.

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:43.430
Someday, you'll be mine-robo.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.790
Adios-robo!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:48.670
We got another one.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:51.570
That was a lot of unnecessary trouble!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.020
Lemuria Impact?

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.530
Interesting.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:19.020
The pages detailing the Scimitar
of Barzai's creation

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:21.530
have returned to Al Azif.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:25.980
It's all going well, isn't it, Kuro Daijuji?

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:27.990
It's about time.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.840
Let's raise the difficulty of the game.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:35.400
Then you'll summon them?

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.880
Yes.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.580
You seem to be enjoying this, master.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.310
Yes. Yes, I am.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:46.590
I'm enjoying this greatly, Etheldreda.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:54.810
It's him, and no one else.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:57.810
In this infinite boredom,

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:03.980
he is the one thing that entertains me,
that makes me burn.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:11.840
This heat alone, no matter how many times
I experience it... I never tire of it.

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:59.120
Clothed in the color of blood and the
stench of death, the sinners come.

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:00.410
Anticross!

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:01.710
They despise the good,

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:04.030
mock love, and drown themselves in tragedy.

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:06.860
Next time: The Invaders.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:10.020
Yet still, justice is here.
